Package: DeepSeekCell
Title: Evidence-Guided Reliability Framework for LLM Cell Annotation
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-11
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohamed", "Kone", role = "aut"),
    person("Shulin", "Wang", email = "books@hnu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hunan University", role = "cph")
  )
Author: Mohamed Kone [aut], Shulin Wang [aut, cre], Hunan University [cph]
Maintainer: Shulin Wang <books@hnu.edu.cn>
Description: Provides an evidence-guided reliability framework for
    marker-based large language model cell type annotation in single-cell RNA
    sequencing. The package converts cluster marker genes into structured
    candidate annotations, scores deterministic marker, ontology and tissue
    evidence, computes evidence-adjusted confidence, selectively refines
    high-conflict predictions under a fixed budget, maps labels to the Cell
    Ontology, exports reports, and supports reproducible benchmarking against
    established annotation methods.
